  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759794,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## DuckTales: The Quest for Gold (Commodore 64)\n\nEmbark on a thrilling adventure in *DuckTales: The Quest for Gold*, a 1990 platform game for the Commodore 64, inspired by the beloved Disney cartoon. Challenged by Flintheart Glomgold, you assume the role of Scrooge McDuck, racing against time (30 days!) to amass the greatest fortune. Travel the globe with Huey, Dewey, and Louie, and pilot Launchpad McQuack in a quest for legendary treasures.\n\nGameplay blends strategic money management with diverse platforming scenarios. Navigate treacherous mountain levels, explore labyrinthine caves, photograph rare wildlife in reserves, and even dabble in the stock market. Beware the Beagle Boys, who’ll try to thwart your progress with pianos and other obstacles. A unique copy protection system requires deciphering a password using a key script from the manual – failure results in a Beagle Boy invasion! Rare finds like Bombastium offer shortcuts, but beware of malfunctioning matter transfer units. With locations and treasures drawn directly from classic DuckTales episodes, *The Quest for Gold* delivers a charming and challenging experience."
    },
